      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze this customer lead submission:\n\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n\nEvaluate the customer's business potential.\n\nClassification:\n- Hot: Strong buying intent, clear business need, and readiness to proceed.\n- Warm: Genuine interest, but needs more information or time.\n- Cold: Weak interest, unclear requirements, or no clear buying intent.\n\nTasks:\n1. Classify the lead as Hot, Warm, or Cold.\n2. Assign a priority score from 1 to 100.\n3. Explain the classification.\n4. Identify the customer's main business problem.\n5. Recommend the next action.\n6. Write a professional follow-up message.\n\nDo not invent missing information.\nA high budget alone does not make a lead Hot.\nFollow the Structured Output Parser schema exactly.",
